{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.CechSplit","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.CechSplit","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.CechNerveValues"],"declarations":19,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.split_pull_bijective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.split_pull_bijective","kind":"theorem","line":304,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechSplit.lean#L304-L368","doc":"**Splitting one set keeps `H²`.** If `A ∪ B = U v` and both `U` and the\nsplit family have preconnected pairwise and triple intersections, pulling\nback along the split is a bijection on `H²` with discrete commutative\ncoefficients. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.split_surj_core","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.split_surj_core","kind":"theorem","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechSplit.lean#L208-L297","doc":"**Surjectivity on values.** Every 2-cocycle on the nerve of the split\nfamily differs by a coboundary from the pullback of a 2-cocycle on `U`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.split_inj_core","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.split_inj_core","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechSplit.lean#L116-L204","doc":"**Injectivity on values.** A 2-cocycle on the nerve of `U` whose\npullback to the split family is a coboundary is itself a coboundary. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.mem_A_or_B","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.mem_A_or_B","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechSplit.lean#L109-L112","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.split_link","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.split_link","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechSplit.lean#L100-L107","doc":"**The link condition.** A preconnected set inside `A ∪ B` meeting both `A`\nand `B` meets `A ∩ B`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.mem_splitFam_some_of","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.mem_splitFam_some_of","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechSplit.lean#L94-L98","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.mem_splitFam_of","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.mem_splitFam_of","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechSplit.lean#L85-L92","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.splitFam_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.splitFam_le","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechSplit.lean#L76-L83","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.splitFam_some_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.splitFam_some_ne","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/